# text = Paragraph 64 of the White Paper rightly refers to the Metropolitan Green Belt , and before the right hon . Member for Orkney and Shetland leaves the Chamber I remind him that the only statutory green belts in this country are the Metropolitan Green Belt and a very small section of green belt somewhere in the region of the Solent .
