# text_id = 1695
# text = In that connection , let me say that I regret that the Government , in their preoccupation with so - called reforms of steel and transport and taxation , have been unable to find the little time which would be necessary to reform the law of conveyancing , the law of selling and purchasing property , and thereby cutting down costs .
