# text_id = 1696
# text = The invidious distinction between the treatment of doctors , judges and Members of Parliament , on the one hand , and of railwaymen and seamen , on the other , is a shameful act coming from a Government and a party who profess to believe in Socialism and in ironing out the social inequalities of present - day society .
