# text_id = 1697
# text = Is the hon . Gentleman aware that his right hon . Friend the Minister of Power published a White Paper in December , 1963 , in which he admitted the continuing shortage of solid smokeless fuel and said that this shortage would become greater in the next few years if we persisted in having any further enlargement of smokeless zones ?
