# text_id = 1698
# text = As I understand Admiralty and Government policy in the past few years , it has been , first , to produce the forces and ships for the purpose of dealing with what has been called the local conflict ; secondly , to build up a strong antisubmarine force ; thirdly , to back their efforts with an effective nuclear strike force .
