# text_id = 1699
# text = When rates of tax on personal incomes in most of the rest of the world are very much smaller than they are here , especially at the higher levels , it is crazy for the hon . Member for Blyth to go on assuming that there is a bottomless reservoir of taxpaying capacity among people better off than himself .
