# text = The subsidy rates introduced on August 1 , therefore , took account of the performance of all middle - water vessels in 1960 , and an increase in subsidy was granted which was based on their average performance and needs ; and that increase amounted , on average , to £ 3 to £ 3 10s . 0d. a day .
