# text = These people , for the purpose of holding meetings , go to the point of assembly led by a band and drums — a Hitler technique in itself — one in Manchester on Sunday last went in close proximity to one of the greatest Jewish populations in this country and a settled coloured community of no fewer than 12,000 persons .
