# text_id = 1725
# text = We feel that the reliefs given in Clause 11 on earned income are so generous , one might even describe them as drastic , that now there is no case for allowing the Surtax payer to set off against his Surtax assessment certain expenses which , while allowable for Income Tax purposes , are objectionable as a deduction from Surtax .
