# text_id = 1727
# text = Is not the Minister aware that when a well - maintained payment is made the local authority has the right to allocate the compensation between the tenant who has spent the money and the landlord , but that if the house is declared fit all of the money goes to the landlord thereby depriving the tenant of his rights ?
