# text = Perhaps one of the major impacts of these negotiations has been on American legislation , because I do not believe that the Trade Act would ever have been put before Congress or passed were it not for the possibility of the creation of the enlarged Community , a very large trading bloc , and the desire to reduce industrial tariffs .
