# text = Is the right hon . Gentleman aware , that , anticipating a lapse of memory on his part , I have with me the OFFICIAL REPORT for 14th December in which he specifically says that the success or failure of the experiment of morning sittings will be judged on whether the House rises earlier or later on those two nights ?
