# text_id = 1763
# text = Therefore , I welcome this Bill because it recognises the existence of this widespread fear , a fact to which sufficient emphasis has not been given in the past in this country ; and also because it faces us with the fact that we cannot have modernisation in this country unless we lay the ghost of the dole queues .
