# text_id = 1772
# text = She has announced her intention of doing so , but this has hardly been discussed , and I hope that the Foreign Secretary will say something about it , because the impact on Europe of the two super Powers having their own system of anti-ballistic missiles , and Europe not having any , could , politically , be very considerable indeed .
