# text_id = 1773
# text = I should certainly like to join the Parliamentary Secretary in complimenting the special committee of the Cotton Board and the very skilled administrative staff which it has , plus the seconded officers from the Board of Trade , on the good job which they are doing in this extraordinarily complex and , to a large extent , new undertaking .
