# text = My Lords , I think we can all agree that this Report is a remarkable piece of work , produced , by order , in absolutely record time and containing many quite admirable proposals for bringing our Foreign Service into line with modern realities , cutting unnecessary expenditure , eliminating much redundant work , and promoting greater efficiency generally .
