# text = In addition to its other duties , particularly connected with low - lying drainage , the East Yorkshire Board has a special flood prevention problem of tidal inundation from 190 miles of the River Humber , the whole of the River Hull , and also the sea defences from Spurn Point to Flamborough Head , and nearly to Filey .
