# text_id = 1795
# text = I , like the hon . Member for Newark ( Mr. Deer ) , am a caravanner , but unlike the hon . Gentleman I am what I think is called a mobile caravanner , as opposed to the hon . Gentleman , who described the delights of the Sussex Downs as viewed from the interior of a static van .
