# text = They have agreed that the conception is one which deserves examination , together with other possible means of developing the concept of a N.A.T.O. multilateral nuclear force ; but they have never given any undertaking to participate in the mixed - manned component although they have agreed to consider providing it , if it is formed , with operational facilities .
