# text = Before my right hon . Friend replies to the Amendment , I would ask him to consider if something can be done for that particular group of people who purchased properties between 1939 and the operative date of 1955 , to enable them to enjoy the privileges which the Bill is seeking to give to many other owner - occupiers .
