# text_id = 1815
# text = If the hon . Member accepts that some system of import control is desirable , and therefore accepts that this must be done by agreement in order to safeguard our trading with other nations , and if the price of this import control is standard quantity at home , does the Labour Party accept the principle of a standard quantity ?
