# text = Would my hon . Friend agree that when hon . Members opposite make unsympathetic remarks and ask , " Are these men yet unemployed ? " they should be asked whether they realise that these are men who have given a long time to the aircraft industry and wish to be employed in the most modern industry that we possess ?
