# text = We held a general review of current problems and policies in economic , financial , trade , defence and political matters ; and , in addition , we discussed a number of specific subjects , including the progress of the Nuclear Tests Conference at Geneva , the difficulties of the shipping industry and the economic problems of the West Indies .
