# text = If the British Government are so confident that circumstances to - day merit the cancellation of these former assurances , and an enlargement of the power and scope of the Sugar Board , surely separate legislation should be submitted to Parliament so that a change in policy of this magnitude may be given the separate attention that such a change demands .
