# text_id = 1838
# text = Various arguments against the Clause will , no doubt , be used this afternoon , just as they have been used before , but my right hon . Friend the Home Secretary has given us a very good example of the value of corporal punishment in that he has retained it in respect of prisoners who use violence against warders .
