# text_id = 1867
# text = The real victims of an unregulated war by powerful groups to increase incomes will be the 5 million to 10 million worthy British citizens , with probably the hardest hit of them all the 1½ million old - age pensioners , who are on fixed or nearly fixed incomes and unable to better themselves in the struggle for increased increments .
