# text = I appreciate the difficulty , but does not the argument of the hon . Member for Crosby ( Mr. Graham Page ) in substance mean an admission of the main argument of my hon . and learned Friend the Member for Northampton ( Mr. Paget ) — that it is possible to get round the Bill by direct sales ?
