# text_id = 1874
# text = I am sure that my hon . Friend is aware of the fact that we are getting considerably increased opportunities for industrial exports to Denmark , under the Convention , but I do not think that we can seriously expect to sell pig meat to the Danes until we can bring our costs of production down to the region of theirs .
