# text_id = 1876
# text = What I would suggest to the Government is that these Orders in themselves — and this as much as the others — are not likely to have the full economic effect which the policy behind these Orders seeks to achieve , unless we have a Chapter VII resolution , a resolution in the United Nations , to back them up .
