# text_id = 1878
# text = Although some local firms , I understand , find it worthwhile to provide special transport from Barnsley for their staff — but not always free of charge — the hospital management committee has not made any proposals to run a bus to Barnsley because , I understand , it does not think such a service would materially improve the staffing position .
