# text_id = 1886
# text = I will not debate the merits of the case on this occasion , but confine my remarks simply to saying that before we adjourn for Whitsun we should be given an assurance that a statement will be made to allay the anxieties of the nursing profession , and that something will be done to alleviate the difficulties that now exist .
