# text_id = 1887
# text = On the one hand , we are told by the Government that they are doing everything they possibly can to induce industrialists to go into areas with high unemployment , while , on the other hand , the industries which are there are threatened with arbitrary taxation at the very moment when they are trying to establish themselves and build up .
