# text_id = 1917
# text = There are certainly more urgent and deserving cases than this , quite apart from those involving State expenditure , such as old - age pensioners — cases of taxpayers who perhaps ought to be helped by tax remissions rather than by total exemption from Schedule A tax , for such exemption would include many people who may or may not be deserving but who are certainly not very needy .
