# text_id = 1918
# text = My main suggestion , which came as a great surprise to my right hon . Friend the Minister of Housing and Local Government when I put it to him the other day , is to set up quickly a committee to examine the question of local income tax , so that people are taxed on their ability to pay and not on the sort of house in which they live .
