# text_id = 1926
# text = I stress that the purpose of the Bill is , as far as possible , to get the right balance between enabling scrap metal dealers to go ahead with their business as efficiently as possible , putting as few limitations on them as is feasible in the conditions under which they work , and ensuring that we are as far as possible stopping the loopholes for those engaged in dishonest transactions .
