# text = I feel that the raising of this matter has been thoroughly justified , and I conclude by again expressing my thanks for the way in which the noble Lord has answered me , although I know that in regard to some of the questions I raised he had only short notice , and I agree that some of them would be extremely difficult to answer in the course of a debate .
