# text_id = 1928
# text = My Lords , as I see the damage that is done to young children of school age who are brought into the courts , who from the moment they enter into the court waiting - room are introduced into a delinquent community , I realise more and more that the one important thing to do is to get the children who are still at school out of the courts altogether .
