# text_id = 1931
# text = I know that the foreign operators will not be paying any more than they were before , but although they have been denied an uncovenanted bonus as a result of devaluation , B.E.A. will certainly pay £ 200,000 a year more on their international routes , on top of the extra £ 100,000 which will be the cost to it , direct or indirect , of the latest Budget .
