# text = That is the basis of the review now taking place of all Government overseas expenditure , and I hope that right hon . and hon . Gentlemen opposite , who have not shown undue signs of impatience about the way in which Government expenditure has grown over the last few years , will at least give us a reasonable period to conduct a proper and sensible investigation before cuts are made .
