# text = Bearing in mind , as a number of hon . Members have pointed out , the importance of the services provided — education , housing , welfare and the rest — this does not compare at all unfavourably with the weekly rent on a television set or , as the hon . Member for Itchen said , with expenditure on the pools and some other items of that kind .
