# text_id = 1941
# text = I was rather interested in the proposition of my hon . Friend the Member for Bristol , South ( Mr. Wilkins ) and of my hon . Friend the Member for Willesden , West ( Mr. Pavitt ) , that we should be indebted to the hon . Member for Ilford , South ( Mr. Cooper ) for being so explicit in his remarks about these two new Clauses .
