# text_id = 1942
# text = It is obvious that those of us who have been closely associated with this school over the years and who have been worried about the deterioration in its use — the misappropriation of the school , to which I shall come later , and the wrong people being entered and the right people being kept out — should wish to continue to bring this matter before Parliament at regular intervals .
