# text_id = 1944
# text = More likely still — this is quite a likely case — there may be a joint delegation from the Federation of Malaya and Singapore , say , on defence , or finance , or on a hundred and one things ; and the extraordinary thing about that joint delegation would be that all the Malayans would come under the full protection of this Bill , but the Singaporeans would not .
