# text = Will the right hon . Gentleman confirm also that the pilot of that plane , who was a constituent of mine , was one of the most experienced of the fleet , and that there is no reason whatever why any further potential passengers should , at any rate so far as is known at present , have cause for anxiety in using either B.E.A. or this type of plane ?
