# text_id = 1946
# text = Although there might well be a good argument for that in the case of some charitable organisations which are of general local benefit , it is a different matter to be compelled to contribute to all charities located in the area whether one approves of their objects or not and , indeed , whether or not the benefit of the charity accrues to the particular authority where its building is situated .
