# text_id = 1947
# text = I have been looking up some of the debates which your Lordships have had on this subject , and I find that in the last three and a half years , or a little more , it has been my duty to reply to your Lordships on behalf of the Government on substantially this subject , in almost these words we are now discussing , no fewer than eleven times .
