# text_id = 1948
# text = For instance , though it set a ceiling for its establishment of 190,000 , it limited the recruitment to 123,000 and explained that , to bring units up to full strength on mobilisation , the Territorial Army Reserve for other ranks would be expanded and open to volunteers who had completed their active service in the T.A. , as well as to National Service men who were drafted there .
