# text = If we can achieve a high and steady level of employment generally throughout Wales , we shall be laying the foundations not only of a happier , but of a healthier Wales for years to come , and we shall surely be helping the mind as well as the body , because the fear of the return of unemployment has eaten deeply into the minds of thousands of people in Wales .
