# text_id = 1957
# text = The sort of course he suggested would be designed to help the civil servant as an administrator , with whatever educational background , first , to understand the way in which scientists think and work and , secondly , to understand the relationship between craftsmen and technicians and scientists , the use of statistics and , in particular , of probability theory , and to understand how science is organised .
