# text_id = 1958
# text = It seems to me that if the Government then say that they are going to restrict this right to relief from double taxation — I emphasise that the Clause is concerned only with relief on double tax — on shareholders in particular types of investment trust companies , they must tell us why the penal payment of double tax is right in the case of other investment trust companies .
