# text_id = 1963
# text = In his Budget speech , the Chancellor gave us a rather dark hint that monetary policy was to be applied perhaps somewhat rigorously in future , and we would like to have some idea of what that policy is to be in so far as it applies to the actual amount of currency and bank notes in circulation , as we all have to stick to that to be in order .
