# text_id = 1968
# text = When one sets alongside that the fact , which has already been observed , that home production has achieved an efficiency which I would judge to be comparable with the best , certainly in the Northern hemisphere , it really seems that the balance of advantage may be in a positive policy of increased home production , rather than in trying to buy as large quantities of imported food .
