# text_id = 1973
# text = While it is perfectly true , I suppose , that when this particular part of the law became out of date the Judges became acute to try to find ways round it , it never became completely a dead letter ; and the result has been that one could never be quite certain , at any rate in a substantial number of cases , whether one needed the Seal or not .
