# text_id = 1974
# text = The only realistic policy is to say that we part company with the delusion that we can or should make or possess nuclear weapons , that we intend to clear out the American bases here , and that we will apply to the military alliances the principle that we will not be committed to war by allies who refuse to come to terms with us on how to make peace .
