# text = I will not go on with the argument the noble Lord , Lord Bannerman , has produced so characteristically and persuasively about Scottish independence and that sort of thing , but will support him on the question of running a region of British railways at a great distance from London in a terrain which , manifestly , most people on this side of the Border simply do not understand .
