# text_id = 1980
# text = Turning from that comparatively peaceful suggestion to the ardours of Parliamentary warfare , we do not propose to divide on the first of these Clauses , not because we do not feel strongly about it , but out of regard for the time of the Committee , and because , as my hon . Friend indicated , we have expressed our opinions on this matter so many times before .
