# text_id = 1981
# text = Would my hon . Friend also take into consideration the necessity of emphasising to the German authorities the importance of ensuring that those who were unable before 1953 to lodge their claims because they were behind the Iron Curtain or were in other respects unable to do so , should have equal treatment with those who justifiably were given compensation in respect of their claims which were made before ?
