# text_id = 1982
# text = Finally , the considerable extension of activity proposed by the new legislation , including the necessity for a liaison machinery with other authorities , the co-ordination of effort , the correspondence with manufacturers , dealers , transport undertakers and the like , the keeping of efficiently maintained records , and legal work in connection with transactions , will demand that any inspectorial staffs are backed by an efficient headquarters administrative organisation .
