# text = I do not wish to sound mealy - mouthed about this , but there are one or two little technical foibles about the drafting of the words " within a period ending seven clear days before the return day of the summons , or , in Scotland , the day fixed for the diet " which my advisers think ought to be examined , particularly with the Scottish authorities .
