# text_id = 1984
# text = The effect , so far as the R.A.F. is concerned , of the agreements with the Malta Government announced yesterday by my right hon . Friend the Minister without Portfolio is that the planned reduction in our establishments in Malta , which involves in particular the disbandment of a Canberra squadron and the closing of the air headquarters , will take place about a year later than was previously proposed .
