# text = Surely we do not want to be in breach of the agreements a moment longer than necessary , and if we are continuing in breach of the agreements the House ought to have an opportunity of looking at them again , and looking at them again in a matter of months , which is the period the Chancellor of the Exchequer himself spoke of in his Second Reading speech .
