# text_id = 1986
# text = In any case , I judge that the strongest reason for any of them to come here is to acquire more experience , which they can then take back and put at the disposal of their fellow citizens in their own countries ; that is surely an argument for welcoming them on a limited - term basis , not for offering them vouchers that will entitle them to settle here permanently .
