# text_id = 1987
# text = We are going to be selective about it , but I would suggest , with all respect , that any chief officers of police who are not fully aware of what the conditions are — and I rather doubt whether there are any — certainly ought to know that they can get in touch with the Home Office and find out ; and I would suggest that they do so .
