# text = I have been asked to suggest , and I am considering following this up , that the Minister of Health might consider whether , since a great many of the cases which come before the General Nursing Council are of a more or less routine nature . , it might be a good plan if the appointment of the assessor need not be obligatory but perhaps could be permissive .
