# text = It is of the order of £ 1 million a year that is being spent by the Government specifically on cancer research ; but there are also lots and lots of other moneys being spent on cancer research by the Medical Research Council which you cannot precisely allocate because it is research into the way that cells work , into the way that tissues function and things of that sort .
