# text_id = 1997
# text = This is , I am afraid , virtually the only control exercised by the Ministry of Health over the authorities ' provision of old people 's homes , for though my Department may advise an authority about siting and planning , my right hon . Friend could not consider himself justified in withholding a recommendation for loan sanction from the responsible local authority unless a serious matter of policy was involved .
