# text_id = 1999
# text = I hope that I shall carry a certain amount of support on both sides , because it is common knowledge that very great hardship has been caused to many people of all political shades of opinion by the erosion in value of money and , therefore , gilt - edged securities over the last 20 years under all Governments , but worse under Labour Governments than under the Conservative Governments .
