# text_id = 2003
# text = There is only one chance , and it is a very slender one , of a solution to the Rhodesian problem being achieved which would be satisfactory to this country and to Rhodesia — this is , a modification of the attitude that has been taken up over a period of more years than one by the present régime in Rhodesia to the political progress and future Constitution of that country .
