# text = The right hon . Member for Belper ( Mr. G. Brown ) mentioned that he wanted to see us as part of a wider outward - looking Community , but I agree with my hon . Friend the Member for Cirencester and Tewkesbury ( Mr. Ridley ) and others who have said that the mere confrontation of ourselves with the Common Market negotiators has resulted in a change of outlook .
