# text_id = 2005
# text = While I take the point that by Lords Amendment No. 14 the figure which the hon . Gentleman has selected can subsequently , if necessary , be varied , I do not think that he has argued the case for exempting all circulations of 25,000 and under with the persuasiveness which he usually used when we discussed this matter both in Committee upstairs and on the Floor of the House .
