# text_id = 2006
# text = For that reason , we have accepted the illogical but nevertheless practical proposition that , as it is impossible to say which part of the professional fee for preparing a set of accounts and the taxable figure on those accounts relates to business purposes and what part to taxation purposes , the generous way is to say that the whole amount should be regarded as a deduction from profits .
