# text_id = 2008
# text = Hon . Members will recognise from the speeches which we have heard from the benches opposite during the course of the debate on the Loyal Address so far that if a Labour Administration were to come into power , it would divest much of that strength and thereby create a dangerous vacuum in the very heart of the Western strategic position , in the very heart of the freealliance of nations .
