# text_id = 2012
# text = He does not always show it because he is naturally reticent , which I suppose was ingrained in him when he was a back - room boy ; but now he is no longer a back - room boy I hope he will come here often and give us the benefit of his opinions and good sneaking , and I hope his noble father will he sitting on his left .
