# text_id = 2014
# text = I had come down to the House last time hoping that the Government would accept the Amendment , at any rate in principle , but if they did not accept it , we were resolved to divide ; and our resolution in that last respect was further fortified by the general enthusiasm to which I have already referred and which was greater and more widespread than even I had expected .
