# text_id = 2015
# text = Then , suddenly — perhaps not even suddenly — we got different invitations to go to Moscow , and , one after the other , Under - Secretaries called us quickly into the Foreign Office — indeed , one was no less a person than the present Leader of the Opposition — to discuss what Russia might put forward and what we should claim for debts we thought we were owed .
