# text_id = 2016
# text = The latest figures given in Economic Trends for February , 1969 , on the incidence of taxes and social service benefits in 1967 , show that the income after direct taxes and benefits as a percentage of original income for incomes up to £ 988 — admittedly marginally less than £ 1,000 — represents 106 per cent . , so that one is a net gainer at £ 1,000 already .
