# text_id = 2021
# text = My experience has been that the best way to influence people is to keep open the channels of communication with them , to avoid appearing to take a too partisan attitude towards them , but in one 's efforts to influence them to leave them in no doubt how strongly one feels on the matter on which one wants to influence them and how great one 's concern is .
