# text_id = 2022
# text = This in turn will enable the banks to switch management expenses at present borne by the special investment department to the ordinary department to the extent of about 5s . or 6 s . per cent. , thus placing the trustee savings banks in a better position to match the rate of interest paid on special investment deposits with that paid by the Post Office Savings Bank on its I.D. deposits .
