# text = For that sum we could have an extremely sizeable fleet of hunter - killers which would be of some effect against the Soviet submarine fleet with which we are likely to be greatly concerned in our part of the world , for we are rapidly coming to have influence in naval matters in one part of the globe rather than all over it , as used to be the case .
