# text_id = 2027
# text = If we go right back to most ancient times , to the institution of the Sabbath , that is the first clear example that I know of in history of the division between time for work and time for rest ; and the Sabbath , although transferred in the Christian Church to the first day , instead of the seventh day , has continued part of our Western tradition ever since .
