# text = Surely the real point behind this debate is whether , taking into account the discretion which is clearly given within this code to local authorities and which I have read out this evening , the authority has acted in a reasonable manner in a sparsely populated district in opening a new school and trying to make a success of it with teachers who have been in their employment for some time .
