# text = I concede that , in the last quarter of 1966 , there was no increase over the third quarter , but that was a small consolation , as the rise in the index of new house prices from the end of the fourth quarter of 1965 to the end of 1966 was 8 points , from 161 to 169 , on top of a 15 point rise the year before .
