# text = Obviously , the main matter with which we were concerned was the suitability or otherwise of the Private Bill procedure and that , of course , inevitably raised the whole question of pipeline policy in general — whether pipelines should be allowed to proliferate all over the country , whether they should be more or less controlled , and who should exercise that control , Parliament or the Government .
