# text = If he does not consider as very important what Members here might say , I hope that he will remember the two sentences that I have quoted from the representative of the old - age pensioners in my constituency and will act accordingly , by changing the timetable and introducing a new one allowing our old people to receive the benefit of the new increases before or immediately after Christmas .
