# text_id = 2040
# text = Politically , I find it much more difficult to understand that this Government , a Conservative Government , should be prepared , in effect , to surrender the political sovereignty of Britain to a West European combination and , in so doing , to sacrifice the economic and political strength which has come to us in the past and which can come increasingly in the future from our Commonwealth association .
