# text = My constituents , believing that the Territorial Army is an instrument of defence rather than the reverse , are of the opinion that it has a rôle to fill in the event of a national emergency , that it has a strong local influence in support of the Regular Forces and that it has a part to play in the social life and training of the younger members of the community .
