# text_id = 2043
# text = My right hon . and learned Friend the Chancellor reconsidered the matter when the Amendment appeared on the Notice Paper , but , having considered it again , he does not feel able to accede to the proposal which has been made . I hope that , in the circumstances , and having in mind the reasons I have given , my hon . Friends will not press their Amendment .
