# text = Since the Prime Minister announced the terms of reference and the membership of the Royal Commission on Local Government , I have been delighted to observe , for example , that almost the only criticism which his statement invoked was a complaint by one or two newspapers that the Royal Commission had not specifically been enjoined by its terms of reference to work out a reform of local finance .
