# text = I would hope that the Minister can assure us that the Board of Trade , equally , will not hesitate to take action if it is found that the unforeseen arises in another direction , and as a result of any approval given by the Board of Trade under this Clause , any agreements which it was the intention of this Bill should be registrable , are escaping attention .
