# text = The noble Lord who introduced this debate with , if I may say so , a very interesting speech , referred a good deal to guided missiles , which certainly figured extensively in the Defence debate a few weeks ago ; and I want to ask a few more detailed questions without going back upon the broad , general , strategic arguments which I ventured to deploy on that occasion .
