# text = We had a very full explanation from the Financial Secretary about the stripper when it came to making absolutely sure that those who were helping those engaged on dividend stripping could rely on the Government 's promise not unduly to interfere in their activity , and he made it perfectly clear that he set great store on the Government 's new policy of not having retrospection in any circumstances .
