# text_id = 2053
# text = All my hon . Friends , and nearly all hon . Members who have spoken from the Government benches , have said that it is not redeployment but unemployment — unemployment for economic reasons , to placate the foreign bankers , if one likes to call it that ; but perhaps to atone for the past failures of the Government would be a more accurate description of what has come about .
