# text = If the word premises is to be left in I presume that it could refer to a dwelling - house with various outbuildings and sheds around it in which the occupier might well be able to keep a few pigs and poultry , which would bring the premises within the terms of the Agricultural Holdings Act or the Small Holdings Act , which are not within the scope of the Bill .
