# text = Without wishing to criticise individuals , and in particular the noble Lord , Lord Todd , to whom we should be extremely grateful for taking the chair of the Advisory Council , the fact is that a number of busy and distinguished scientists , meeting half a dozen or more times a year , are not really in a position to give the sort of review that we need .
