# text_id = 2068
# text = All the Government Departments concerned — Welsh Office , Board of Trade , Ministry of Labour , Ministry of Power , Department of Economic Affairs — are in - formed about closure proposals so that Ministers can be told if a proposed closure is likely substantially to increase unemployment in areas where men are already being discharged from other industries , and the coal industry is unable to offer alternative employment .
