# text = Would it not be a great deal more simple and sensible if the Government exempted from charge all those stocks which are already held by retailers , the vast majority of whom are not at present registered for purchase tax , whether the stock in question was sold as a raw material , as a textile , or as a finished product — say , a set of curtains ?
