# text_id = 2070
# text = If it had not been for the United Nations , the willingness of Khrushchev to pack up his weapons , crate them and cart them home — under supervision — could not have been expected , because no other form of supervision that I can think of except supervision under the United Nations would be accepted by the Americans , the Russians or , perhaps , even by the Cubans .
