# text = Is he arguing that a person acquitted on a majority verdict would prefer instead the situation , which could arise at present , where there might be a ten - to - two vote and a hung jury and a second trial at which it would be impossible for him to prove that , at the first trial , perhaps as many as eleven thought he was not guilty ?
