# text_id = 2072
# text = If there is to be the major reorganisation for which hon . Members opposite ask in order to make the railways pay , it should not be forgotten that thousands of men who are at present driving diesel engines and locomotives will be reduced to the grade of fireman and thousands of firemen will go back to the grade of cleaner , resulting in the loss of several pounds a week .
