# text = While thanking my right hon . and learned Friend for that answer , may I ask him whether he agrees that it would be of great benefit to British nationals if we could get reciprocal arrangements with as many countries as possible and that one of the best ways of doing that is to stop free medical treatment to nationals of countries which do not have reciprocal arrangements with us ?
