# text = In subsection ( 3 ) it is provided — I paraphrase — that when Section 70 of the Army Act is applied , when a person subject to military law commits the offence of murder overseas and is tried by court - martial — if he commits it in the United Kingdom , he will not be tried by court - martial — he shall be liable to imprisonment for life .
