# text_id = 2081
# text = I question very much whether I correctly interpret these tables , but I read in Table Z.2 of Appendix 1 — and I am sure that someone in the Department will check this — that the number of students from England and Wales entering English and Welsh universities between 1960 and 1970 is likely to go from 24,000 to 36,000 — an increase of 50 per cent . in ten years .
