# text_id = 2082
# text = I want all Purchase Tax other than on a few exempted items , including pianos , placed on a flat rate of 16 ⅔ percent . , and when we come to the Question " That the Clause stand part of the Bill " I shall dwell on the advantages that would derive from the whole of this 45 per cent . bracket coming down to 16 ⅔ per cent .
