# text_id = 2083
# text = I remember a case which I tried not long ago , when I was still in office , in which I did my best to keep the damages to what I thought would be a reasonable amount ; but the jury came back and awarded very heavy damages in favour of two Members of Parliament and another person who , as I thought , had been scandalously defamed in the newspapers .
