# text_id = 2086
# text = How that can be represented as control over the Armed Forces , as I understand he is reported to have said tonight , I cannot myself comprehend , though we must always bear in mind , in the overheated atmosphere in Rhodesia , the possibility of being misreported , not least as I gather that he was addressing from outside his offices a crowd of exuberant and perhaps rather extremist supporters .
