# text_id = 2088
# text = If the hon . Member has in mind the agreement reached on the allocation of the forces at the intergovernmental meeting on defence held in Salisbury in September , I am prepared , if the hon . Member so wishes , to arrange for the publication in HANSARD of the text of the agreed statement by Governments which was issued , following that meeting , on 11th October , 1963 .
