# text_id = 2089
# text = It deals with contributions by the Greater London Council to the execution of works , to the expenditure by a borough council ; but , of course , the contribution by the Greater London Council to any one borough comes from the money which the Greater London Council collects from all boroughs or , to put it in another way , which other boroughs are obliged to pay without any escape .
