# text_id = 2091
# text = The Bill provides that if the Government cannot see their way clear completely to abolish the surcharge within a limited time , the House , in the first instance , shall have an opportunity to debate the matter by way of the submission by a draft Order and , in the second place , if it goes beyond the final date it will be necessary to consider fresh legislation .
