# text_id = 2092
# text = I heard some disgruntled noises from my Front Bench when the hon . Gentleman said that the Liberal Party were the founders of the Welfare State , but I for one am prepared to say that probably the greatest breakthrough we saw in this country towards the ultimate destruction — we have not yet achieved it — of vicious , stinking , privilege , was created by Lloyd George .
