# text = However , my fear is that , while we have these good labour relations in Glasgow and Grangemouth and elsewhere , there has been to some extent a conspiracy of silence on the part of unions and employers — both sides of industry — which have not brought forward to the Devlin Committee , have not , in fact , generally admitted , some of the difficulties and problems which exist .
