# text_id = 2095
# text = In the debate on the principle on the Tuesday , he indicated that he would have something to say in his reply which would please the right hon . Member for Orkney and Shetland ( Mr. Grimond ) very much , but to my disappointment that open mind had changed to a closed mind by the Thursday , when all he said was that he would look further into the position .
