# text_id = 2096
# text = Finally , looking to the future , it would be helpful if the Minister could tell us when he expects — he was fairly general in his opening remarks — that the revenue from the bridge after meeting the operating and maintenance costs will be adequate to meet interest payments and thereby avoid the capitalisation of interest , thus ceasing to add to the capital cost of the bridge .
