# text_id = 2097
# text = So all we do here is to say that , where a retailer or user of an instrument returns the source either for repair or recharging or because it is surplus , that transfer is exempted , but that any ultimate disposal of waste in the true sense of the word as we understand it in ordinary parlance is still , by registration and authorisation , the responsibility of the manufacturer .
