# text_id = 2098
# text = The hon . Member asks leave to move the Adjournment of the House under Standing Order No. 9 to discuss a definite matter of urgent public importance , namely , the failure of Her Majesty 's Government to maintain , and at the Commonwealth Prime Ministers ' Conference to establish , the convention that Commonwealth members have no right to interfere in the internal affairs of sovereign member States .
