# text_id = 2099
# text = In the first place , the special position of a holder of a licence of right is recognised by the provision in Clause 59 that he shall pay no interim charges before the charging scheme comes into operation ; and by reason of this provision , of course , the present abstracter will have several years of warning before he is required to pay any charges for his water .
