# text = There must be quite an industry in producing price tickets with the price of , for example , 2s . 6d . written in letters as big as a banner headline in a newspaper , while side by side a special type , legible only to those with exceptional eyesight , states that this relates to half a pound and not , as might be supposed , to a larger quantity .
