# text_id = 2104
# text = I have done my best in very difficult circumstances , and I hope that it has made some impression on the Financial Secretary , although I very much doubt it But I hope that hon . Members opposite who have stayed to listen will one day use their influence in the 1922 Committee on behalf of these new Clauses and others which we are trying to get the Chancellor to accept .
