# text = The hon . Member for Bermondsey ( Mr. Mellish ) , in his agreeable speech last night , rather gave the show away when he said , " I only hope that we " — that is , the Labour Party — " can find men of the calibre of Dr. Beeching to prepare reports for us as Dr. Beeching is now preparing reports for the Conservative Government " .
