# text_id = 2109
# text = Not very much information was given on Second Reading about these important clauses , and when I put the Amendment down I was not quite sure whether the proposals were intended mainly for small farms in owner - occupation or for every small and uneconomic holding , and how much they will be applicable — and are intended to be applicable — also to tenants of rented farms on agricultural estates .
