# text_id = 2110
# text = Then , later on , when we had turned out a batch or two , we were able to place contracts either at a fixed price or at what we used to call a " bogy price " , which meant a maximum price plus a share in savings — and the cheaper the manufacturer could produce it the larger was the share in the savings which he got .
