# text_id = 2112
# text = While thanking my hon . Friend for that reply , which shows a very close appreciation of the difficulties involved in building this hotel , may I ask him whether it is not obvious that as only one tender was received and it was unacceptable , the terms which have been put into the contract must be so rigid , unremunerative and complicated that no contractor can even afford to tender ?
