# text_id = 2113
# text = Where , however , land is settled land the trustees of the settled land offer the land as mortgage to the Agricultural Mortgages Corporation or the Land Improvements Company , who in turn produce the capital , and the tenant for life has to pay back both the capital and the interest out of his own private money , and he cannot be recouped from the capital of the trust .
