# text_id = 2122
# text = My Amendment is an attempt , at any rate , even if it is technically inaccurate , to provide that the person who occupies adjoining premises will have at least some chance of finding out that a certificate is being applied for , because if this Amendment were to be accepted the application would have to be advertised in the newspapers at a certain stated time before the application was made .
