# text_id = 2125
# text = I am sorry that the Home Secretary is not here because , after all , he is responsible now for Rhodesia , and he had , perhaps , better get used to sitting here and taking part in our debates on these subjects so that he may equip himself even better than he is now to deal with these questions which have been now suddenly thrust upon him so unexpectedly .
