# text = Unlike my hon . Friend , I would have liked to see the Bill go through , but unlike my hon . Friend , whose position I well understand — and I have had plenty of time to understand it anyway — I feel it would have been highly agreeable to have got an agreed solution in this House on this problem which has been left alone for too many years .
