# text_id = 2130
# text = Would the hon . Gentleman remember that when we have an international collaborative aircraft the engine is almost inevitably provided by Rolls - Royce , and this means that the rest of the aircraft — the avionics and the airframe — has to be provided by overseas designers and suppliers , and that this is not a basis on which to maintain a healthy aircraft industry in this country ?
