# text_id = 2131
# text = The situation that has arisen is that if Israel , not having the benefit of guarantees for the uninterrupted passage of her ships through the Suez Canal and the Straits of Tiran , is not able , either by pact through the United Nations or through her own arrangements , to obtain the most concrete promises of aid and protection against further aggression she will be driven to acquiring nuclear arms .
