# text = I have found a tendency to suggest that there is an increase in this type of behaviour in this country ; but I think that objective analysis will show that this matter has been far more freely discussed at the present time and that there is no evidence — from the nature of things there could be no evidence — that there has been an actual increase in such behaviour .
