# text_id = 2141
# text = The settlement of the German question is a very large issue , but I would have thought that in the present situation , with West Germany absorbed economically within the Common Market , if there were to be a reunification of Germany — for which we all hope — there would be nothing to inhibit the enlarged Germany taking its place within the comity of the free nations of Europe .
