# text = We must not rest content until further facilities are provided for many junior clubs — not merely the well - known clubs , but junior clubs where chaps who are not particularly expert can get a good game and enjoy themselves In my view this is particularly important in relation to great built - up areas , such as the enormous conurbation which we have in the West Midlands .
