# text_id = 2145
# text = My Lords I am glad that the noble Lord did not preface his remarks by saying that this Amendment is self - explanatory , because we needed all he had to give us in the way of explanation ; and , even now , I cannot claim to understand the new clause , I welcome , however , his assurance that it safeguards the rights about which we were inquiring .
