# text_id = 2146
# text = I am not speaking of the right hon . Gentleman — that would not be courteous — but there are some doctrinaires in this country who have got themselves into a position of arguing that we must not accept what is the best solution for Britain , on the ground that the French will not have it , when in fact the French are urging something very like it upon us .
