# text = It is difficult to keep pace with all this , let alone get ahead , but on this occasion I can feel in a friendly frame of mind because I think that my right hon . Friend said so much of good sense and that his colleague , my right hon . Friend the Minister of Housing and Local Government , has also been laying stress on just the right things .
