# text = I think that my hon . and learned Friend departed from his usual rigid logic when he endeavoured to establish a distinction on that ground between defects in the trial by reason of misdirection for which the accused was not responsible , and defects in the trial because the facts were not brought properly before the jury , as though in the second cast the fault lies with the appellant .
