# text_id = 2157
# text = In moving the Amendment and concentrating on the example of my constituency , I am demonstrating not only the great injustice which is being done on the constitutional principle of people being unable to exercise their votes in a just way , but also the injustice of having these over - large constituencies completely changing in character and making it very difficult for these people to be properly represented .
