# text_id = 2162
# text = I do not differ entirely from the noble Earl when he spoke of a " hunch " in these matters , because I think ultimately we may , in estimating whether something is a deterrent or not , have to use a " hunch " , because the most useful reports that can be put before us cannot give us any evidence of how many people are in fact deterred .
